---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Anirudh Bompada"
  description="How this personal website uses privacy-conscious, cookie-free analytics."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Useful insights. <span class="accent">Minimal tracking.</span></h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      This site uses privacy-conscious analytics to understand which pages are useful,
      without asking visitors to sign in or providing personalized advertising.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-grid">
    <aside aria-label="Privacy summary">
      <p>ANALYTICS / UMAMI CLOUD</p>
      <p>ANALYTICS COOKIES / NONE</p>
      <p>UPDATED / NOVEMBER 7, 2026</p>
    </aside>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What the site measures</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami Cloud</a> for traffic
        analytics. It measures pageviews and visits, referring websites, approximate
        visitor location (such as country), and technical information such as
        browser, operating system, device type, and screen size.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site does not ask visitors to create accounts or provide personal
        contact details, and it does not intentionally attach names, email
        addresses, or persistent personal identifiers to analytics events.
      </p>

      <h2>How Umami handles analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Umami does not use analytics cookies. To estimate visits, it derives an
        anonymous session identifier from information including the visitor's
        IP address and browser details, using a salt that rotates periodically.
        IP addresses are processed to derive approximate location and session
        information, but are not stored as fields in standard analytics records.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your browser connects to Umami Cloud to load the analytics script and send
        events. Umami and its infrastructure providers may separately process or
        retain IP addresses in operational or security logs. The site excludes
        URL query parameters and fragments from its Umami tracking.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        The tracker is configured to honor a browser's Do Not Track preference
        when the browser exposes that signal. Browser privacy extensions may
        also block analytics. The website remains usable if tracking is blocked.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention and provider information</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics retention depends on the Umami Cloud plan. Its free Hobby plan
        retains production analytics for six months. Separate backup and
        operational-log retention policies may apply. This site does not sell
        visitor analytics or use them for targeted advertising.
      </p>
      <p>
        For information about Umami's processing practices, see the
        <a href="https://umami.is/privacy">Umami Privacy Policy</a>. This notice
        will be updated if the site's analytics practices or providers change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
